{"code":"014825","name":"동원시스템즈우","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"포장재","sector_desc":"종이·플라스틱·유리 포장재. 내수 소비와 원재료 가격의 영향을 받는 방어적 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 1980년 설립된 첨단소재 전문기업으로, 동원산업이 최대주주이며, 베트남 소재 Tan Tien Packaging 등 4개의 종속회사를 보유하고 있음. 연포장재, 알루미늄박, 성형용기 등 포장재와 이차전지용 알루미늄 양극박 및 배터리용 원형캔을 생산하며, 세계 전역으로 수출하고 있음. 2021년 엠케이씨 합병으로 이차전지 부품 사업에 진출하고, 이차전지 솔루션 프로바이더로 도약하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-27","n_days":299,"close":13570.0,"open":13230.0,"high":13570.0,"low":13230.0,"volume":2,"amount":27140.0,"ret_1d":0.6677,"gap":-1.8546,"range_pct":2.5055,"ret_5":-0.8766,"ret_20":-0.9489,"ret_60":2.803,"ret_120":-17.5076,"ret_250":-24.1899,"ma20":13499.5,"ma60":13727.1667,"ma120":14222.5,"ma200":15273.75,"close_vs_ma200":-11.1548,"close_vs_ma60":-1.1449,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-2.0329,"r2_60":0.002,"slope_120":-29.4142,"r2_120":0.4875,"slope_250":-30.87,"r2_250":0.878,"high52":19340.0,"low52":12800.0,"pos_52w":11.7737,"dd_52w":-29.8345,"mdd_1y":-32.1164,"atr14_pct":2.9161,"vol_ann_60":29.1532,"vol_avg20":99.15,"vol_ratio20":0.0202,"vr5":0.0485,"vr20":0.2726,"amount_avg5":144804.0,"amount_avg20":1329248.5,"amount_avg60":2754158.3333,"obv_chg20":-17.5492,"turnover_20":0.7508,"pv_eff_20":-1.2638,"rsi14":49.0926,"frgn_net_5":-4.0,"inst_net_5":2.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0015,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0008,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0008,"frgn_net_20":-3.0,"inst_net_20":73.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0011,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0276,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0265,"frgn_net_60":-86.0,"inst_net_60":193.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0326,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0731,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0405,"frgn_net_120":34.0,"inst_net_120":201.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0129,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0761,"smart_net_120_pct":0.089,"foreign_ratio":0.38,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":314.0,"op_margin_q":7.8071,"op_qoq":141.5385,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":21.2355,"rev_yoy":9.8007,"op_trend_4q":21.6921,"fin_period":"202606","roe":7.26,"debt_ratio":71.91,"per":6.27,"pbr":0.44,"div_yield":4.79,"foreign_rate"